msgstr ""
"Denne bjælke måler det installerede websted. Den officielle Plugin Check og"
" den levende godkendelsesproces for Automatisering/sikkerhed er fortsat "
"separat dokumentation for udgivelse."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin.php:909
msgid ""
"This bar tracks the listed 1.16.0–1.20.0 delivery milestones. Overall "
"product readiness, production acceptance and competitive parity use "
"separate evidence."
msgstr ""
"Denne bjælke følger de angivne leveringsmilepæle 1.16.0–1.20.0. Den samlede"
" produktparathed, produktionsgodkendelse og konkurrenceevne kræver separat "
"dokumentation."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-site-plan.php:165
msgid ""
"This campaign intentionally stops at the selected task/scan bound. After "
"reviewing these drafts, build another preview to continue remaining "
"content."
msgstr ""
